    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.poster.avif?t=1651436345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.webm?t=1651436345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.mp4?t=1651436345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Beast Whalers is a naval tactical roguelike set in an original fantasy setting. Manage your fleet of unique ships and fight your way through hordes of sea monsters, unfavorable weather and the limitations of your own vessels to solve the mystery of the sudden appearance of Corruption in your kingdom's colonies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><br><strong>Collect and manage a unique fleet</strong><br>Each ship has a unique special ability that makes it useful in different situations. Hiring ships of the same class grants you a special bonus. Every possible fleet combination has its ups and downs so experiment with different builds.<br><br><strong>Maneuver on a hexagonal grid</strong><br>A ship cannot move backwards, it can\u2019t easily sail against wind and can only shoot from the sides. But will this stop you?<br><br><strong>Undo actions</strong><br>You\u2019ll make a lot of tactical decisions. During battles you can undo your actions freely up to the beginning of a turn so experiment and always make the best choice.<br><br><strong>Permadeath</strong><br>Upgrade and repair your ships but be warned - once a ship is sunk it\u2019s gone forever!<br><br><strong>Adapt to procedurally generated world</strong><br>Face a series of random levels with different layouts that will significantly alter your strategy each time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/e6a14aec369dc1f358978aa2c5acacdb.avif?t=1651436345\" /></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.poster.avif?t=1651436345\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.webm?t=1651436345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/dcf30cb9bd04ef99acd2400323436877.mp4?t=1651436345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Beast Whalers is a naval tactical roguelike set in an original fantasy setting. Manage your fleet of unique ships and fight your way through hordes of sea monsters, unfavorable weather and the limitations of your own vessels to solve the mystery of the sudden appearance of Corruption in your kingdom's colonies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><br><strong>Collect and manage a unique fleet</strong><br>Each ship has a unique special ability that makes it useful in different situations. Hiring ships of the same class grants you a special bonus. Every possible fleet combination has its ups and downs so experiment with different builds.<br><br><strong>Maneuver on a hexagonal grid</strong><br>A ship cannot move backwards, it can\u2019t easily sail against wind and can only shoot from the sides. But will this stop you?<br><br><strong>Undo actions</strong><br>You\u2019ll make a lot of tactical decisions. During battles you can undo your actions freely up to the beginning of a turn so experiment and always make the best choice.<br><br><strong>Permadeath</strong><br>Upgrade and repair your ships but be warned - once a ship is sunk it\u2019s gone forever!<br><br><strong>Adapt to procedurally generated world</strong><br>Face a series of random levels with different layouts that will significantly alter your strategy each time.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814700/extras/e6a14aec369dc1f358978aa2c5acacdb.avif?t=1651436345\" /></div>",
    "short_description": "Beast Whalers is a naval tactical roguelike about assembling and controlling your own fleet to battle bizarre sea monsters. Trade and upgrade unique ships, use their special abilities, and maneuver carefully between enemies on tight, procedurally generated levels.",
